{"id":"this_is_private_property","lines":[{"t":0.007,"end":1.735,"chars":[0],"who":"Old Man","text":"Got permission?","de":"Haben Sie die Erlaubnis?","orig":"scenes/this_is_private_property/lines/01.mp3"},{"t":1.297,"end":2.641,"chars":[1],"who":"Hubert","text":"Yea -uhh","de":"Yea -uhh","orig":"scenes/this_is_private_property/lines/02.mp3"},{"t":2.067,"end":4.563,"chars":[0],"who":"Old Man","text":"Written permission from Trey Taylor?","de":"Schriftliche Genehmigung von Trey Taylor?","orig":"scenes/this_is_private_property/lines/03.mp3"},{"t":4.217,"end":5.441,"chars":[1],"who":"Hubert","text":"Trey Taylor?","de":"Trey Taylor?","orig":"scenes/this_is_private_property/lines/04.mp3"},{"t":5.013,"end":6.069,"chars":[0],"who":"Old Man","text":"Crew Tractor.","de":"Crew Traktor.","orig":"scenes/this_is_private_property/lines/05.mp3"},{"t":6.089,"end":7.481,"chars":[1],"who":"Hubert","text":"Oh, crew tractor","de":"Oh, Crew-Traktor","orig":"scenes/this_is_private_property/lines/06.mp3"},{"t":6.779,"end":10.883,"chars":[0],"who":"Old Man","text":"Y- yeah he- who- who told you can fish here?","de":"Y- yeah he- who- who told you can fish here?","orig":"scenes/this_is_private_property/lines/07.mp3"},{"t":10.385,"end":12.281,"chars":[1],"who":"Hubert","text":"I thought it was State Property.","de":"Ich dachte, es wäre Staatseigentum.","orig":"scenes/this_is_private_property/lines/08.mp3"},{"t":12.394,"end":13.81,"chars":[0],"who":"Old Man","text":"State?!","de":"Staat","orig":"scenes/this_is_private_property/lines/09.mp3"},{"t":13.265,"end":14.057,"chars":[1],"who":"Hubert","text":"Yeah","de":"Yeah","orig":"scenes/this_is_private_property/lines/10.mp3"},{"t":13.913,"end":16.577,"chars":[0],"who":"Old Man","text":"This?! State?!","de":"Das?! Bundesland?!","orig":"scenes/this_is_private_property/lines/11.mp3"},{"t":14.592,"end":15.096,"chars":[1],"who":"Hubert","text":"Yeah","de":"Yeah","orig":"scenes/this_is_private_property/lines/12.mp3"},{"t":15.448,"end":16.672,"chars":[1],"who":"Hubert","text":"It a'int?","de":"A 'int?","orig":"scenes/this_is_private_property/lines/13.mp3"},{"t":16.545,"end":21.321,"chars":[0],"who":"Old Man","text":"Hit the road, dude. This ain't no state property. This is private property.","de":"Mach dich auf den Weg, Kumpel. Dies ist kein Staatseigentum. Dies ist Privateigentum.","orig":"scenes/this_is_private_property/lines/14.mp3"},{"t":21.25,"end":21.946,"chars":[1],"who":"Hubert","text":"Oh, okay","de":"Oh, ok.","orig":"scenes/this_is_private_property/lines/15.mp3"},{"t":21.436,"end":23.74,"chars":[0],"who":"Old Man","text":"What is your name? I want your name.","de":"Wie heißt du? Ich will deinen Namen.","orig":"scenes/this_is_private_property/lines/16.mp3"},{"t":23.5,"end":24.244,"chars":[1],"who":"Hubert","text":"(Make this noise idk what it is)","de":"(Machen Sie dieses Geräusch idk zu dem, was es ist)","orig":"scenes/this_is_private_property/lines/17.mp3"},{"t":23.888,"end":26.48,"chars":[0],"who":"Old Man","text":"So I can call down and see who gave you permission. On state property.","de":"Also kann ich anrufen und sehen, wer dir die Erlaubnis gegeben hat. Auf staatlichem Grundstück.","orig":"scenes/this_is_private_property/lines/18.mp3"},{"t":26.319,"end":27.183,"chars":[1],"who":"Hubert","text":"My name?","de":"Mein Name","orig":"scenes/this_is_private_property/lines/19.mp3"},{"t":26.748,"end":28.644,"chars":[0],"who":"Old Man","text":"On state property.","de":"State Property","orig":"scenes/this_is_private_property/lines/20.mp3"},{"t":27.964,"end":29.188,"chars":[1],"who":"Hubert","text":"My name Hubert.","de":"Mein Name ist Hubert.","orig":"scenes/this_is_private_property/lines/21.mp3"},{"t":29.161,"end":30.241,"chars":[0],"who":"Old Man","text":"Last name?","de":"Nachname","orig":"scenes/this_is_private_property/lines/22.mp3"},{"t":30.106,"end":31.33,"chars":[1],"who":"Hubert","text":"Jones.","de":"Herr JONES","orig":"scenes/this_is_private_property/lines/23.mp3"},{"t":31.178,"end":36.578,"chars":[0],"who":"Old Man","text":"Hubert Jones, state property, I ain't never heard that before in my life.","de":"Hubert Jones, Staatseigentum, das habe ich noch nie in meinem Leben gehört.","orig":"scenes/this_is_private_property/lines/24.mp3"},{"t":36.6,"end":38.256,"chars":[1],"who":"Hubert","text":"Yeah man, uh.","de":"Ja Mann, äh.","orig":"scenes/this_is_private_property/lines/25.mp3"},{"t":37.09,"end":39.802,"chars":[0],"who":"Old Man","text":"chuckle","de":"te.","orig":"scenes/this_is_private_property/lines/26.mp3"},{"t":39.526,"end":41.47,"chars":[1],"who":"Hubert","text":"Tryna supply on this?","de":"Probieren Sie den Vorrat dazu aus?","orig":"scenes/this_is_private_property/lines/27.mp3"},{"t":40.86,"end":41.916,"chars":[0],"who":"Old Man","text":"What?","de":"Was?","orig":"scenes/this_is_private_property/lines/28.mp3"},{"t":41.676,"end":44.172,"chars":[1],"who":"Hubert","text":"You said Tractor's supply on this pond right here?","de":"Du hast den Vorrat des Traktors an diesem Teich genau hier gesagt?","orig":"scenes/this_is_private_property/lines/29.mp3"},{"t":43.384,"end":47.968,"chars":[0],"who":"Old Man","text":"Crew Trey Taylor and Crew Tractor.","de":"Crew Trey Taylor und Crew Tractor.","orig":"scenes/this_is_private_property/lines/30.mp3"},{"t":47.489,"end":48.713,"chars":[1],"who":"Hubert","text":"Okay.","de":"Okay.","orig":"scenes/this_is_private_property/lines/31.mp3"},{"t":48.209,"end":50.537,"chars":[0],"who":"Old Man","text":"I'm his Daddy","de":"Ich bin sein Papa","orig":"scenes/this_is_private_property/lines/32.mp3"},{"t":50.245,"end":51.469,"chars":[1],"who":"Hubert","text":"Hey yo daddy?","de":"Hey, Daddy?","orig":"scenes/this_is_private_property/lines/33.mp3"},{"t":50.939,"end":58.235,"chars":[0],"who":"Old Man","text":"\"And a man just called me and called Trey and said, \"Trey, they're fishing this pond.\" He said, \"Lock them up.\"\"","de":"\"Und ein Mann rief mich gerade an und rief Trey an und sagte:\"Trey, sie fischen in diesem Teich.\" Er sagte:\"Schließ sie ein.\"\"","orig":"scenes/this_is_private_property/lines/34.mp3"},{"t":58.064,"end":59.288,"chars":[1],"who":"Hubert","text":"Aw man.","de":"Oh Mann.","orig":"scenes/this_is_private_property/lines/35.mp3"},{"t":59.14,"end":61.516,"chars":[0],"who":"Old Man","text":"Lock em Up!!","de":"Sperrt sie ein!!","orig":"scenes/this_is_private_property/lines/36.mp3"},{"t":61.35,"end":62.19,"chars":[1],"who":"Hubert","text":"mhm","de":"mhm...","orig":"scenes/this_is_private_property/lines/37.mp3"},{"t":62.159,"end":63.575,"chars":[1],"who":"Hubert","text":"We about to leave, man.","de":"Wir sind dabei zu gehen, Mann.","orig":"scenes/this_is_private_property/lines/38.mp3"},{"t":63.05,"end":67.226,"chars":[0],"who":"Old Man","text":"You better leave cuz I'm telling you he going to call the law.","de":"Du gehst besser, weil ich dir sage, dass er das Gesetz anrufen wird.","orig":"scenes/this_is_private_property/lines/39.mp3"}]}